  "slug": "super-washing-machines",
  "hints": [
    "First check whether the total number of dresses can be divided evenly among all machines.",
    "Let target be the required number of dresses in each machine, then compute each machine's surplus or deficit.",
    "Track the cumulative surplus of the prefix as you scan from left to right; its magnitude tells you how much flow must cross a boundary.",
    "The answer is the largest value among the positive local surplus and the absolute cumulative imbalance."
